{"id":"n68093-2-8","stage":5,"title":"오류 · 过失","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68093-2-8-1","ko":"이건 제가 주문한 요리가 아닌데요?","zh":"这不是我点的菜吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"주문한","meaning":"订购，预定，下单","explanation":"주문하다：订购，预定，下单；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주문하다","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91768","senseId":"1","lemma":"주문하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문한","audio":"/audio/64aec70c7c232b702260.mp3"}},{"text":"요리가","meaning":"菜，菜肴，料理","explanation":"요리：菜，菜肴，料理；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"2","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리가","audio":"/audio/10224a307bf15aa06bfa.mp3"}},{"text":"아닌데요?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"아닌데요","audio":"/audio/b2d7d41f1167b41c2cf7.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닌데요","audio":"/audio/b2d7d41f1167b41c2cf7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"dc82df55affb977b","term":"주문하다","zh":"订购，预定，下单","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3","entryId":"91768","definition":"向相关制造商或销售商告知自己所需要的物品种类、数量、模样、规格等，并叮嘱对方按要求制造或送货。","pronunciation":["주ː문하다"]},{"id":"aa664b105a07ea19","term":"요리","zh":"菜，菜肴，料理","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3","entryId":"30199","definition":"经过烹调好的食物。","pronunciation":["요리"]}],"audio":"/audio/ab0de94cf14563f0f630.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68093-2-8-2","ko":"죄송합니다, 손님. 오류가 있었던 모양입니다.","zh":"非常抱歉，客人。看来出现了错误。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}},{"text":"손님.","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}},{"text":"오류가","meaning":"过失，错误","explanation":"오류：过失，错误；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오류","audio":"/audio/b49f20d86148ddfda470.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68093","senseId":"2","lemma":"오류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오류가","audio":"/audio/ce3ad37cdf1f8dfa51dd.mp3"}},{"text":"있었던","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었던","audio":"/audio/dd197669df7045e75d3d.mp3"}},{"text":"모양입니다.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양입니다","audio":"/audio/044577de052e0e3b76c6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"b49f20d86148ddfd","term":"오류","zh":"过失，错误","audio":"/audio/b49f20d86148ddfda470.mp3","entryId":"68093","definition":"错误或失误。","pronunciation":["오ː류"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e78c25ce1d3ea69921a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.329,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68093","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["非常抱歉，客人。看来出现了错误。","这不是我点的菜吧？","那不是我以前见过的手表吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这不是我点的菜吧？","那不是我以前见过的手表吧？","非常抱歉，客人。看来出现了错误。"],"answer":2}]}
